+Changes made to migrate from `requests` to `urllib3`:

+- Replaced `requests` imports and session usage with `urllib3.PoolManager`.

+- Updated request calls (`get`, `post`, `put`, `delete`) to use `urllib3` methods and request arguments.

+- Replaced `requests` exception handling with `urllib3` exception handling.

+- Adjusted response handling to use `urllib3` response attributes (`status`, `data`) instead of `requests` response methods/properties.

+- Kept the class, function, and variable names unchanged.

